u}T^{
u}} igr)=\sum_{\lambda\in\Lambda^{+}(d,n)}a_{\lambda}\,\dim_F igl(W^{\lambda}\varphi_{T^{
u}T^{
u}} igr)$$ for every partition $
u\in\Lambda^{+}(d,n)$, where $\varphi_{T^{
